recommendation:
Take TV 1.7.0 whole (WP-S06a-07) once all of these hold:
- VV ToolState reads the Dimension and Shape setups' defaultAtScale instead of hard-coding true (TV ToolState__.js:219,232), and CreateDimension stores Dimension__AtScale;
- dimension records carry Start/EndExtensionMm, ExtensionsLinked, RoundUp, LinePt and LineStyle;
- DimensionRounding exists;
- MarkupBridge exports SheetDimensionPt;
- LineStyleTool takes 'dim'.

To load at all, the panel needs only SheetDimensionPt and PanelHost's LinkedPairRow and ShowLink. Add the 7 DimAtScale and DimRoundUp labels, and reword VV AppConfig LayoutEditor__Measurements__Description (VV :457), which says 'atScale is hardcoded true so DrawingScale works'.

